OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fdry through the evening and overnight.
OL,7,FMostly cloudy but with some clear
OL,8,Fintervals. Winds turning southeasterly
OL,9,Fovernight and strengthening over the
OL,10,FWestern Isles.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA dry morning with bright
OL,13,Fspells. Turning increasingly cloudy
OL,14,Fthrough the afternoon with some light
OL,15,Frain possible in the south later.
OL,16,FSoutheasterly winds becoming strong
OL,17,Fwith gales over Western Isles.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
