OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FRain
OL,6,Fspreading east Wednesday, then sunny
OL,7,Fspells and showers, strong winds with
OL,8,Fgales or severe gales in west. Bright
OL,9,Fspells and showers Thursday, strong
OL,10,Fwinds easing. Cloudy with rain Friday.
